    from jsonb_populate_record(null::public.immersion_missions, $seed${"slug":"b2-disputing-a-roaming-charge","title":"Disputing an unexpected phone bill","level":"B2","status":"published","sort_order":200,"metadata":{},"context_text":"You've just come back from a week's holiday in Turkey. Your monthly mobile bill is three times higher than usual, even though you were sure you had switched off mobile data roaming before you left.","objective_text":"Understand the charge, weigh the operator's offer, make a formal written case, and pass on what you've learned.","mission_type":"problem_solving","target_vocabulary":["roaming","statement","goodwill gesture","formal complaint","waive"],"target_grammar":"reporting and hedging (According to your agent… I was not made aware that…)","cultural_note":"With most service providers, a polite but firm written complaint creates a record and is taken more seriously than a phone call. Stating the outcome you expect is normal, not rude.","success_conditions_json":["Identify what caused the high bill and the deadline for a review","Understand the cause the operator gives and the two options offered","Write a formal complaint that explains why the charge is unfair and states the outcome you expect","Give a friend practical advice to avoid the same problem"],"skill_mix":["reading","listening","writing","speaking"]}$seed$::jsonb) r
